flowchart TB

  start([Start])
  has_repo{Repo available?}
  scan_repo[Scan Repo]
  manual_input[Manual Input]
  has_docs{Docs complete?}
  enrich[Enrich with LLM]
  build_graph[Build Graph]
  quality_ok{Quality gate?}
  generate[Generate Assets]
  review[Human Review]
  done([Export])

  start --> has_repo
  has_repo -->|Yes| scan_repo
  has_repo -.->|No| manual_input
  scan_repo --> has_docs
  manual_input --> has_docs
  has_docs -->|Yes| build_graph
  has_docs -.->|No| enrich
  enrich --> build_graph
  build_graph --> quality_ok
  quality_ok -->|Pass| generate
  quality_ok -.->|Fail| review
  review -.->|Retry| build_graph
  generate --> done